Notable differences from upstream
---------------------------------
* Packages, modules, CLI and environment variables are renamed
  (crewai -> shards_ai_agents, CLI `crewai` -> `shards-agents`, CREWAI_* -> SHARDS_AI_AGENTS_*).
* Upstream-hosted endpoints (telemetry, PyPI version check, crewai.com / app.crewai.com
  / docs.crewai.com) were removed or pointed at the reserved ".invalid" TLD so that
  nothing is sent to the upstream service. Telemetry is off unless
  SHARDS_AI_AGENTS_TELEMETRY_BASE_URL is set; the version check is off unless
  SHARDS_AI_AGENTS_VERSION_CHECK_URL is set.
* Versioned documentation snapshots (docs/v*) and upstream release workflows were removed or disabled.
